iability into a licensing regime.","cites":["analysis/ai-copyright-litigation","litigation/nyt-v-openai"]},{"id":"private-credit-contagion","year":2028.3,"layer":"economy","text":"AI displacement marks down SaaS-heavy private credit; the insurance-PE nexus turns a sector repricing into a household balance-sheet event.","cites":["sources/2028-global-intelligence-crisis"]},{"id":"weights-theft","year":2029.4,"layer":"security","text":"A frontier lab's model weights are exfiltrated by a state actor; security requirements jump a tier and export politics harden.","cites":["sources/ai-2027","concepts/export-controls-ai"]},{"id":"ghost-gdp","year":2031.6,"layer":"economy","text":"'Ghost GDP' enters the lexicon: output that appears in national accounts but never circulates, because machines do not spend.","cites":["sources/2028-global-intelligence-crisis","concepts/ai-and-productivity"]},{"id":"eu-decision-point","year":2031.7,"layer":"geopolitics","text":"Europe faces its leverage moment over lithography and market access; the choice made in 2031 sets its decade.","cites":["sources/europe-2031"]},{"id":"labor-constitution","year":2035.3,"layer":"labor","text":"Work's social contract is renegotiated: wage insurance, flexicurity variants, and the first serious dividend schemes.","cites":["concepts/ai-labor-disruption","sources/europe-2031"]}],"layers":{"economy":[{"year":2042,"text":"Demand crisis: the displacement spiral in force \u2014 ghost GDP, fiscal undershoot, private-credit stress, emergency redistribution politics.","cites":["sources/2028-global-intelligence-crisis"]},{"year":2057,"text":"Whatever the 2020s broke or built, mid-century output is dominated by AI-run production; the argument is allocation.","cites":["sources/ai-2040-plan-a"]}],"labor":[{"year":2042,"text":"Split labor market: augmented professions pull ahead, exposed ones hollow; geography and sector decide who feels which future.","cites":["concepts/ai-displacement-vs-augmentation"]},{"year":2062,"text":"Work as identity loosens: dividend schemes, contribution economies, and the post-work constitution debates.","cites":["concepts/ai-labor-disruption"]}],"law":[{"year":2042,"text":"Patchwork doctrine: state laws multiply, preemption contested, copyright settled into licensing, liability migrating from disclosure to outcomes.","cites":["analysis/ai-copyright-litigation","analysis/eu-vs-us-ai-regulation"]},{"year":2057,"text":"Personhood at the bar: digital minds, AI counsel, and liability for autonomous systems define the mid-century docket.","cites":["sources/ai-2040-plan-a"]}],"geopolitics":[{"year":2042,"text":"The race entrenches: compute blocs, chip chokepoints, Taiwan premium; every summit is about AI even when it isn't.","cites":["analysis/us-china-ai-competition"]},{"year":2062,"text":"Power follows compute and its energy; the map of capability is the map of leverage.","cites":["concepts/compute-governance"]}],"public":[{"year":2062,"text":"A generation raised with minds-on-tap; the meaning politics the far field keeps on the table.","cites":["sources/machines-of-loving-grace"]}],"science":[{"year":2072,"text":"The frontier is nonhuman: discovery outpaces comprehension, and translation becomes its own discipline.","cites":["sources/ai-2040-plan-a"]}],"climate":[{"year":2072,"text":"Climate outcomes track governance more than compute: the decisive variable was always deployment speed of what the science found.","cites":["industries/energy"]}]}}